    /// `java.lang.Thread` mirror with `name` set on slot 0 and
    /// (optionally) `tid` on slot 2 — `register_native_thread`
    /// already stamped the registry entry, this call just attaches
    /// the mirror so look-ups by `ObjectRef` succeed.
    ///
